# An age-encrypted backup of a release or server key. Keys never go in
# git, not even encrypted (DESIGN 10.2; docs/spec/update-manifest.md).
*.age
/bin/
# What `npm run build` in web/ writes next to the placeholder: only
# internal/webui/dist/index.html is checked in (DESIGN 3.12).
/internal/webui/dist/assets/

# The capture kit's scrub report holds the original private values it
# replaced (tools/capture/scrub.py). It never belongs in the repo.
*-scrub-report.txt

# Bytecode Python writes beside a script it imports, such as the kit's
# scrub.py when a test or a person imports it.
__pycache__/
